// Project 02 uses the virtual button as an EXTI0 source. A Renode GPIO output
// has one destination, so this Project 02-only overlay replaces the built-in
// UserButton -> GPIOA0 connection with UserButton -> EXTI0. The firmware still
// configures EXTI0/RTSR/IMR/NVIC and services IRQ6 exactly as on hardware.
UserButton:
    -> exti@0
